custom models via LiteLLM in Trae\n\n**Description**:\nWe would like to enhance Trae by adding support for integrating custom models using [LiteLLM](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm), similar to the existing support for OpenRouter. This will allow developers to route requests through a variety of model providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Mistral, Cohere, etc.) using a unified LiteLLM endpoint.\n\n**Use Case**:\nThis integration will enable teams to:\n\n* Use a single API interface to switch between different LLM providers via LiteLLM\n\n**Feature Requirements**:\n\n* Ability to add and configure a LiteLLM endpoint through the Trae interface or configuration.\n* Support for model selection\n* Option to route requests through LiteLLM in the same way OpenRouter is currently supported.\n\n**Reference**:\nLiteLLM GitHub: [https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/983/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":14,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/983/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3957111480","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/983#issuecomment-3957111480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/983","id":3957111480,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7r3Lq4","user":{"login":"Trae-AI-Admin","id":192575406,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3p3rg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192575406?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI-Admin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Adm